{"seq":3,"slug":"a-restorer-of-the-dynasty","title":"A Restorer Of The Dynasty","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"victory-and-power","title":"平定太平天国","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/victory-and-power","wordCount":1761,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"final-years","title":"晚年与身后","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/life-and-times/a-restorer-of-the-dynasty/final-years","wordCount":2045,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现曾国藩作为\"中兴名臣\"的巅峰与晚年。经过十余年艰苦鏖战，曾国藩率湘军攻破天京、平定太平天国，挽救了清王朝，登上权力与声望的顶峰——而他在巅峰时所展现的清醒、谦退（主动裁撤湘军），更体现了过人的修养。晚年他推行洋务、力图自强，最终病逝任上，谥号\"文正\"。本章呈现曾国藩功成名就而不忘清醒的完整人生。\n"}